%% Example for the BAM Data Store: material synthesis and characterization. Arrows go from
%% parent to child, and the experimental steps are linked through the samples they use and
%% make. Datasets hang off the experimental step that made them.

    Synthesis["<b>Material synthesis</b><br>Object type: EXPERIMENTAL_STEP<br>In: Lab Notebook<br>Space: Home space (FB username)<br>Project: Material synthesis and characterization<br>Collection: Experimental Steps"]:::dsdo
